# SSRF Auditing Rule (TBHM Module 15 & 25-Check Multi-Agent Framework)

When tasked with auditing SSRF vulnerabilities, remote URL fetchers, or cloud metadata access:
1. Follow the **25-Check Audit Matrix** in `.agents/skills/ssrf-audit/references/ssrf_checklist_tracker.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/ssrf-audit/SKILL.md`.
3. Evaluate against IMDSv1/v2 requirements, RFC 1918 egress restrictions, URL parser differentials, and DNS rebinding resilience.
4. Record structured findings in `artifacts/ssrf_vulnerability_report.json`.
